#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.ksnakeduel.appdata.xml:12
msgid "KSnakeDuel is a simple Tron-Clone. You can play KSnakeDuel against the computer or a friend. The aim of the game is to live longer than your opponent. To do that, avoid running into a wall, your own tail and that of your opponent."
msgstr "KSnakeDuel je jednostavna kopija igre Tron. Možete igrati KSnakeDuel protiv računala ili prijatelja. Cilj je igre nadživjeti protivnika. Da biste to postigli, izbjegavajte sudar sa zidom, vlastitim repom i repom protivnika."
